# ==============================================================================
# GitHub Personal Access Token (PAT) Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# Target Account: N-Y-Public (Public OSS Project: marp-slide-mcp)
# Required Scopes: repo, read:org
#
# Usage Options:
# 1. [Recommended for Developer Environment]:
#    Set the repository-specific environment variable in your OS (Windows / Linux / macOS):
#      GITHUB_PAT_MARP_SLIDE_MCP="ghp_your_token_here"
#    This eliminates the need to create or store plaintext tokens on disk.
#
# 2. [Standard OSS Clone Option]:
#    Copy this file to .env and set your token:
#      cp .env.example .env
#    Note: .env is strictly excluded in .gitignore and will never be committed.
# ==============================================================================
GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN=ghp_your_personal_access_token_here
